				},
				{
					"id": 750390202,
					"content": "呜哇…是一个…说话像大人的小孩子，好奇怪！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750390203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750390203,
					"content": "喂，你的父母没有教过你尊重我这样的人吗？要知道，小小的人也能做出大大的事来！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750390204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "马尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750390204,
					"content": "事实上，许多大大的事，正是由像我这样小小的人所成就的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750390205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "马尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750390205,
					"content": "他还有胡子！噫…看起来有点恶心…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750390206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750390206,
					"content": "至少不要拿胡子羞辱我！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750390207,
						750390220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "马尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750390207,
					"content": "你好，我是黑暗，你的老朋友。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750390208
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750390208,
					"content": "呃…不，你不用这样配合我，我的意思是我…我快死了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750390209,
						750390214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "马尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750390209,
					"content": "哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750390210
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750390210,
					"content": "变得像小鱼干一样了呢…真可怜。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750390211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750390211,
					"content": "呜呜…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750390212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750390212,
					"content": "喂，你们身为人类的同理心哪里去了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750390213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "马尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750390213,
					"content": "给我水！我要渴死了，难道你们看不出来吗！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "马尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750390214,
					"content": "你需要什么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750390215
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750390215,
					"content": "啊，太好了…我在这里困了三天，终于听到了一句人话…！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750390216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "马尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750390216,
					"content": "我要两份九号餐，一份大九号，一份六号餐多加酱，一份七号餐，两份四十五号，其中一份加芝士，再来一杯大枫达。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750390217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "马尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750390217,
					"content": "好的，你还需要什么吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750390218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750390218,
					"content": "唔，嗷？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750390219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750390219,
					"content": "还需要什么？还需要什么！我需要水！我要渴死了，你们难道第一眼看不出来吗！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "马尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750390220,
					"content": "请你振作点，我们该怎么帮助你？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750390221
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750390221,
					"content": "水…请给我水…谢谢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "马尼菲科"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7503903,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_AUTO",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_AND",
